# Fan-out without a gateway: a fork whose branches jump to a merge, and a
# multi-target jump.
# covers: §6.2, §7.4
title "Order sync"

pool Shop
  lanes Orders, Billing, CRM
  lane Orders
  start Order placed
  service Publish order
  fork
    -
      lane Billing
      service Update billing
      -> Sync done
    -
      lane CRM
      service Update CRM
      -> Sync done
  xor Sync done
  service Archive order -> Audit log, Search index
  service Audit log
  end Logged
  service Search index
  end Indexed
